@startuml
skinparam Shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 12

title Luong quan tri du lieu UNU Trip Backend - /admin

|Quản trị viên|
start
:B1: Muon vao khong gian quan tri thi nhap dia chi /admin\tren tien trinh trinh duyet;

|Trình duyệt|
:B2 Chi khi ADMIN BASIC USER va ADMIN BASIC PASS ton tai tai may chu\: trinh duyet hien popup Basic Authentication\nQuan tri nhap tai khoan mat khau;

|Backend Node Express|
:B3 Middleware doc header Authorization\: \nKhong doi env Basic - cho qua (dev)\nHoac doi Basic dung neu co env - so sanh timing safe voi bien ADMIN\nSai hoac thieu header - tra 401 text Unauthorized;

|Quản trị viên|
:B4 Chon noi dung\: tong quan dashboard\sCRUD nguoi dung\sCRUD dia diem\sTrang he thong\sRAG AI hoac bao cao AI;

|Trình duyệt|
:Gui cac HTTP GET POST toi route /admin theo menu;

|Backend Node Express|
:B5 Handler xu ly\: truy van cap nhat qua repository MySQL\nHoac fetch post toi FastAPI admin khi route can (vi du rag ai);

|MySQL va FastAPI RAG|
:Thuc hien ghi doc du lieu ung dung tren MySQL\nHoac xu ly API noi bo tren may chu RAG;

|Backend Node Express|
:Render HTML phia may chu hoac tra JSON;

|Trình duyệt|
:B6 Ve lai bang bieu mau KPI theo HTML tra ve;

|Quản trị viên|
stop

@enduml
